# blink-monitor rules

- Workspace denies `unsafe`; keep that lint intact in `blink-monitor/Cargo.toml`.
- Keep `StatusSnapshot` and `HistoryPoint` field names stable; the web client depends on them exactly.
- Use `tracing` instead of `println!`.
- Avoid exposing ports `8790`/`8788` directly; assume a TLS reverse proxy.
- Run `cargo fmt --all`, `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features -- -D warnings`, and `cargo test --workspace` before finishing.
- The `rust-best-practices` skill applies to all work in this glob.
